### =============================================
### 🔧 VARIABLES
### =============================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost
@academicUrl = http://localhost:8080
@statisticsUrl = http://localhost:8081

### =============================================
### 🔐 AUTENTICACIÓN
### =============================================

### Login como Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Login como Teacher
# @name loginTeacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher01",
  "password": "Teacher@123"
}

###

@teacherToken = {{loginTeacher.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Login como Student
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "Student@123"
}

###

@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Registrar nuevo estudiante (público)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newstudent01",
  "email": "newstudent01@universidad.edu",
  "password": "NewStudent@123",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Mendoza",
  "studentCode": "STU-2026-100",
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-03-15T00:00:00Z",
  "program": "Ingeniería de Sistemas",
  "semester": 3
}

### =============================================
### 👨‍🎓 STUDENTS (Requiere autenticación)
### =============================================

### Listar todos los estudiantes (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Listar estudiantes con búsqueda
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?page=1&pageSize=5&search=Carlos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Obtener estudiante por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Crear estudiante (Admin)
# @name createStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "González",
  "studentCode": "STU-2026-200",
  "email": "maria.gonzalez@universidad.edu",
  "phone": "+57 300 1234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "2001-07-22T00:00:00Z",
  "program": "Ingeniería de Software",
  "semester": 5
}

###

### Crear estudiante (Teacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{
  "userId": 2,
  "firstName": "Pedro",
  "lastName": "Ramírez",
  "studentCode": "STU-2026-201",
  "email": "pedro.ramirez@universidad.edu",
  "phone": "+57 310 9876543",
  "dateOfBirth": "2003-01-10T00:00:00Z",
  "program": "Ingeniería de Sistemas",
  "semester": 2
}

###

### Actualizar estudiante (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "López Actualizado",
  "email": "carlos.updated@universidad.edu",
  "phone": "+57 320 5555555",
  "program": "Ingeniería de Sistemas",
  "semester": 6,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Desactivar estudiante (Solo Admin - Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ❌ Intento sin autenticación (debe fallar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students

###

### ❌ Intento como Student crear estudiante (debe fallar 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": 3,
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Forbidden",
  "studentCode": "STU-FAIL",
  "email": "fail@test.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "program": "Test",
  "semester": 1
}

### =============================================
### 📚 COURSES (Requiere autenticación)
### =============================================

### Listar todos los cursos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Obtener curso por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Crear curso (Admin)
# @name createCourse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "code": "CS-401",
  "name": "Inteligencia Artificial",
  "description": "Introducción a IA y Machine Learning",
  "credits": 4,
  "teacher": "Dr. Alan Turing",
  "semester": 8,
  "maxStudents": 30,
  "schedule": "Lun-Mie 14:00-16:00"
}

###

### Crear curso (Teacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{
  "code": "CS-402",
  "name": "Computación en la Nube",
  "description": "Arquitecturas cloud con AWS y Azure",
  "credits": 3,
  "teacher": "Prof. García",
  "semester": 7,
  "maxStudents": 25,
  "schedule": "Mar-Jue 10:00-12:00"
}

###

### Actualizar curso
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Programación Avanzada (Actualizado)",
  "description": "Curso actualizado con nuevos temas",
  "credits": 4,
  "teacher": "Prof. Martínez",
  "maxStudents": 40,
  "schedule": "Lun-Mie-Vie 08:00-10:00",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Desactivar curso (Solo Admin - Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =============================================
### 📝 ENROLLMENTS (Inscripciones)
### =============================================

### Inscribir estudiante en curso
# @name createEnrollment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}

###

### Obtener inscripciones por estudiante
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments/student/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Obtener inscripciones por curso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments/course/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Dar de baja (withdraw) una inscripción
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments/1/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =============================================
### 📋 ATTENDANCE (Asistencia)
### =============================================

### Registrar asistencia - Presente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "date": "2026-05-08T08:00:00Z",
  "status": 1,
  "notes": "Asistió puntualmente"
}

###

### Registrar asistencia - Ausente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 2,
  "date": "2026-05-08T08:00:00Z",
  "status": 2,
  "notes": "No asistió a clase"
}

###

### Registrar asistencia - Tardanza
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 3,
  "date": "2026-05-08T08:00:00Z",
  "status": 3,
  "notes": "Llegó 15 minutos tarde"
}

###

### Registrar asistencia - Excusa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 4,
  "date": "2026-05-08T08:00:00Z",
  "status": 4,
  "notes": "Excusa médica presentada"
}

###

### Obtener asistencia por inscripción
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances/enrollment/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =============================================
### 📊 GRADES (Calificaciones)
### =============================================

### Registrar nota - Quiz
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 1,
  "value": 4.5,
  "weight": 0.10,
  "description": "Quiz 1 - Fundamentos",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-05-01T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### Registrar nota - Parcial (Midterm)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 2,
  "value": 3.8,
  "weight": 0.25,
  "description": "Primer parcial",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-05-05T14:00:00Z"
}

###

### Registrar nota - Final
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 3,
  "value": 4.2,
  "weight": 0.30,
  "description": "Examen final",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-06-15T09:00:00Z"
}

###

### Registrar nota - Proyecto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 4,
  "value": 5.0,
  "weight": 0.20,
  "description": "Proyecto final - Sistema de gestión",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-06-10T16:00:00Z"
}

###

### Registrar nota - Tarea (Assignment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 5,
  "value": 4.0,
  "weight": 0.15,
  "description": "Tarea 3 - Patrones de diseño",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-04-20T23:59:00Z"
}

###

### Obtener notas por inscripción
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/grades/enrollment/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =============================================
### 📈 DASHBOARD / STATISTICS SERVICE
### =============================================

### Resumen global del dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Estadísticas por curso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Estadísticas por estudiante (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/students?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Estadísticas de un estudiante específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Top 5 cursos por inscripción
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/top-courses?top=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Top 3 cursos por inscripción
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/top-courses?top=3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Resumen de asistencia (global)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Resumen de asistencia por curso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/attendance?courseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Resumen de notas (global)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Resumen de notas por curso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/grades?courseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Actividad reciente (últimas 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/activity?count=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Actividad reciente (últimas 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/activity?count=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Estadísticas por programa académico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =============================================
### 🏥 HEALTH CHECKS
### =============================================

### Health - API Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Health - Academic Service (directo)
GET {{academicUrl}}/health

###

### Health - Statistics Service (directo)
GET {{statisticsUrl}}/health

### =============================================
### 🔄 FLUJO COMPLETO DE PRUEBA
### Ejecutar en orden secuencial
### =============================================

### 1. Login como admin para obtener token
# @name flowLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

@flowToken = {{flowLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 2. Crear un nuevo curso
# @name flowCreateCourse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

{
  "code": "CS-FLOW-01",
  "name": "Curso de Prueba Flow",
  "description": "Curso creado durante el flujo de prueba",
  "credits": 3,
  "teacher": "Prof. Test Flow",
  "semester": 5,
  "maxStudents": 20,
  "schedule": "Vie 14:00-17:00"
}

###

### 3. Verificar que el curso fue creado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

###

### 4. Inscribir estudiante existente (ID 2) en el nuevo curso
# @name flowEnrollment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "courseId": 1
}

###

### 5. Registrar asistencia para la inscripción
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "date": "2026-05-08T08:00:00Z",
  "status": 1,
  "notes": "Presente - Flujo de prueba"
}

###

### 6. Registrar una nota para la inscripción
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": 1,
  "type": 1,
  "value": 4.7,
  "weight": 0.10,
  "description": "Quiz de prueba - Flow",
  "evaluatedAt": "2026-05-08T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 7. Verificar dashboard actualizado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}

###

### 8. Ver estadísticas del estudiante
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{flowToken}}
